<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30921" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκαῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκῇ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without aim</i> or
			<i>purpose</i>, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of
			things, <i>random, purposeless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίκτει γὰρ οὐδὲν ἐσθλὸν εἰκαία
					σχολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					308
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς εἰκαῖον ὄν</span> as being
				<i>useless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>JConf.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. διήγημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJProoem.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ως</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, δοξάζειν</span> cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.30U.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Diotog.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.1.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.128
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Cra.</u>
				p.26
			</span></i> P.: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότερον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.276
			</span></i>: neut. pl. as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				748
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>rash, hasty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				7.7.5
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ πολλοὶ καὶ εἰ.</span>
			Cebes <i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εἰ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRyl.</u>
					235.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ordinary, casual</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.10.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; <i>taken at random</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Comm.Math.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			; <i>careless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφίξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				50.9.10
			</span></i>.</div>
